Oh, in C#10 lambdas can have attributes too [C#10 lambda attributes](https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/csharp/language-reference/proposals/csharp-10.0/lambda-improvements#attributes)

So we should also test

```csharp
  MyClass (object args) {
    ... ([UnmanagedCallersOnly] static (bool is10x, nint state) => { });
  }
```

It will be a similar kind of mangling, with `<>`
